the included file MANIFEST was generated by 
executing ls > MANIFEST in the Janus
executing ls -R >> ../MANIFEST in the Janus/src directory

If editing the help files:
use qhelpgenerator kernunos.qhcp kernunos.qhc after making the appropriate changes
have to regenerate in directory as dir info is coded in sql files, also make sure 
source names in qhc/qhcp files match those in assistant.cpp

qhelpgenerator kernunos.qhcp -o kernunos.qhc
qhelpgenerator kernunos.qhp -o kernunos.qch